    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d142-a2">

                <pb facs="0251" n="171" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg171"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Dr. Canright.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-06-23"><hi rendition="#italic">June 23,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Telegram received. Demand from local officials adequate protection for
                    missionaries and native Christians and keep me fully advised.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
